      "description": "Hate speech is speech that attacks a person or group on the basis of race, religion, gender, or other characteristics. The meme is an example of hate speech because it uses the image of Adolf Hitler and a vulgar pun to dehumanize and mock victims of genocide, specifically Jewish people.",
