      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_1a54053b",
      "@type": "TargetCommunity",
      "instance_name": "audience_id",
      "label": "audience description",
      "description": "The target community is individuals who are familiar with historical references to Adolf Hitler and the Holocaust, and who may find crude, vulgar humor offensive or provocative. The meme is designed to shock and provoke, likely targeting an audience that appreciates dark humor, shock value, or internet meme culture that thrives on controversial and hateful content. The use of the word 'gas' as a vulgar pun implies the audience understands the slang meaning and is willing to engage with the offensive juxtaposition. The meme's intent is to spread hate, so the target audience is likely those who are not sensitive to antisemitic or genocidal content and may be drawn to the meme for its shock value or perceived edginess, despite its deeply offensive nature.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
